# Scrollbars

Native scrollbars stay **hidden** throughout Carrier mock-up UI. Scroll still works (trackpad, wheel, keyboard).

## Do

- Rely on the global hide in `css/components.css`.
- For primary scroll surfaces (tables, long panels), use `DS.bindOverlayScroll` so floating thumbs appear **only while scrolling**.

## Do not

- Leave always-visible native scrollbars on filters, nav panes, modals, or tables.
- Invent page-specific scrollbar styling that fights the global hide.
